    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "Add Movement::ToMatch. move_selection calls kate_text::matching_bracket. A mate moves the head to that offset. Extend::No makes a caret there. Extend::Yes keeps the anchor. No mate leaves the selection unchanged. In (a(b)c), a caret at offset 0 moves to offset 6. A caret at offset 3 moves to offset 4. Leave brackets.rs unchanged. Leave keys.rs unchanged. This packet adds no key binding. Leave session.rs, lib.rs, and files.rs in kate-ui unchanged. PKT-0051 owns those files. Leave bar.rs unchanged. PKT-0067 owns that file. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip."
  },
